---
// Services section + demo case-study cards + contact form + pricing modal
---

<!-- ─── SERVICES ─── -->
<section id="services" class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

    <!-- Section heading -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out mb-14 text-center">
      <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-primary/30 bg-brand-primary/8 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary"></span>
        Available Now
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-4xl">
        What I Can Build for You
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-text-secondary">
        I've spent years solving real operational problems for small businesses — including building a full inventory management system that tracked over $80,000 in warehouse and truck inventory. I know what it looks like when nothing quite works the way it should.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Service cards -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">

      <!-- Card 1: Tech Consulting & Systems -->
      <div class="card-lift group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8">
        <button class="service-card-toggle flex w-full items-center gap-4 text-left md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-0 md:cursor-default md:pointer-events-none">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary md:mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8"/><path d="M12 17v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="flex-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary md:mb-3 md:flex-none md:text-xl">Tech Consulting & Systems</h3>
          <svg class="chevron h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-text-secondary/40 transition-transform duration-300 md:hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out md:max-h-none">
          <ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:mt-0 md:text-base">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Audit your current tools and workflows
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Build or improve Google Sheets / Airtable / Notion systems
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Set up inventory tracking, sales tracking, or reporting
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Automate repetitive processes — save hours every week
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary">Starting at $75/hr or flat-rate</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Website Design & Development -->
      <div class="card-lift group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8">
        <button class="service-card-toggle flex w-full items-center gap-4 text-left md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-0 md:cursor-default md:pointer-events-none">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary md:mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="flex-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary md:mb-3 md:flex-none md:text-xl">Website Design & Development</h3>
          <svg class="chevron h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-text-secondary/40 transition-transform duration-300 md:hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out md:max-h-none">
          <ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:mt-0 md:text-base">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Custom websites built to convert — not just look good
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Landing pages, business sites, portfolios, and eCommerce
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Shopify store setup and optimization
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Monthly maintenance plans — no tech headaches for you
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary">Starting at $350 · Flat-rate packages</p>
            <button
              id="open-pricing-modal"
              class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline cursor-pointer transition-colors"
            >View Full Pricing →</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Custom Software & Integrations -->
      <div class="card-lift group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8">
        <button class="service-card-toggle flex w-full items-center gap-4 text-left md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-0 md:cursor-default md:pointer-events-none">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary md:mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="flex-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary md:mb-3 md:flex-none md:text-xl">Custom Software & Integrations</h3>
          <svg class="chevron h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-text-secondary/40 transition-transform duration-300 md:hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out md:max-h-none">
          <ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:mt-0 md:text-base">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Web apps and tools built for your specific workflow
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              API integrations between your existing platforms
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Internal tools your team will actually use
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-primary" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              Ongoing development retainers available
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary">Starting at $500 · Scoped per project</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing hint -->
    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out mt-8 rounded-xl border border-brand-primary/20 bg-brand-primary/5 px-5 py-4 text-center text-sm text-text-secondary">
      Not sure what you need?
      <a href="https://calendly.com/daniel-trackt/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-brand-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline">Book a free 20-minute discovery call</a>
      — no pressure, no commitment.
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── DEMO CASE-STUDY CARDS ─── -->
<section id="demos" class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out mb-12 text-center">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary/60">Work I've Built</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Live demos — see it in action</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-text-secondary">
        Every demo is a real working site I built to represent a common small-business challenge. Click through — they're live.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

      <!-- Ridgeline Towing -->
      <article class="card-lift flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="h-1 w-full" style="background:#F97316;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:rgba(249,115,22,0.1);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary">Ridgeline Towing</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color:#F97316;">Towing & Recovery</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">The Problem</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">No web presence to capture emergency service calls at 2am — losing business to whoever showed up first in a Google search.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">What I Built</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Mobile-first site with one-tap click-to-call, service area map, and 24/7 trust signals above the fold.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://demo.trackt.tech/towing/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-70"
            style="color:#F97316;"
          >
            View live demo
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Rialto Restaurant -->
      <article class="card-lift flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="h-1 w-full" style="background:#D4820A;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:rgba(212,130,10,0.1);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D4820A" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l19-9-9 19-2-8-8-2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary">Rialto Restaurant</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color:#D4820A;">Fine Dining</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">The Problem</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">A polished restaurant with no online home — guests couldn't find hours, menus, or make reservations without calling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">What I Built</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Elegant menu showcase with nightly specials, reservation integration, and a visual identity that matches the dining room.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://demo.trackt.tech/restaurant/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-70"
            style="color:#D4820A;"
          >
            View live demo
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Keller Realty -->
      <article class="card-lift flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="h-1 w-full" style="background:#60A5FA;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:rgba(96,165,250,0.1);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60A5FA" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary">Keller Realty</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color:#60A5FA;">Real Estate</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">The Problem</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Agent with 500+ deals and a 4.9-star reputation — but buyers couldn't find listings or a way to start the conversation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">What I Built</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Property showcase site with featured listings, social proof stats, and a lead-capture contact flow that converts.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://demo.trackt.tech/realestate/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-70"
            style="color:#60A5FA;"
          >
            View live demo
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pipeline CRM -->
      <article class="card-lift flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="h-1 w-full" style="background:#16B4D2;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:rgba(22,180,210,0.1);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16B4D2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1"/><rect x="10" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1" opacity="0.5"/><rect x="17" y="3" width="5" height="18" rx="1" opacity="0.3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary">Pipeline CRM</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color:#16B4D2;">Sales Tool</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">The Problem</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Deals tracked in a spreadsheet no one trusted — leads falling through the cracks with no visibility into the pipeline.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">What I Built</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Visual deal pipeline with stage tracking, per-deal notes, and a weekly summary view so nothing gets missed.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://demo.trackt.tech/crm/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-70"
            style="color:#16B4D2;"
          >
            View live demo
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Bloom Studio Booking -->
      <article class="card-lift flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div class="h-1 w-full" style="background:#A78BFA;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text-primary">Bloom Studio</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color:#A78BFA;">Appointments</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">The Problem</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">A busy salon managing bookings over text messages — double-bookings, no-shows, and hours lost to scheduling back-and-forth.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-5">
            <p class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary/60">What I Built</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Online booking system with service catalog, staff calendars, and automated confirmation so the owner can focus on clients.</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://demo.trackt.tech/booking/"
            target="_blank"
